SUMMARY:Birdwatching Nature Journals & Scavenger Hunt (Columbia)
DESCRIPTION:Participants of all ages are invited to come out for our last collaboration of the season with NCWF\, Pocosin Lakes NWR\, and Pocosin Arts School of Fine Craft! Please join us for a fun afternoon of creating our very own nature journals for recording bird and other wildlife observations. After creating our journals\, we’ll go outside and see if we can observe a list of common species along the Scuppernong River Boardwalk! These monthly art and nature programs will pick back up in September. Registration is required for these free family programs. Please reserve your spot at https://pocosinarts.org/event/bird-watch-journal-scavenger-hunt-may-6-2026/
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/birdwatching-journals-scavenger-hunt/
CATEGORIES:Featured
END:VEVENT
