SUMMARY:Green Swamp Tour (Supply)
DESCRIPTION:Join NCWF and the Sierra Club Croatan chapter for a tour of the unique carnivorous plants and fire-dependent species of the Green Swamp. We will identify as many species as possible\, exploring shoestring\, green bean\, and pocosin ecotones of the longleaf pine savanna habitat. \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/green-swamp-tour-supply/
CATEGORIES:Featured
END:VEVENT
