CREATED:20260306T161938Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260327T145803Z
UID:10001512-1778832000-1779033600@ncwf.org
SUMMARY:High Country Wildlife Habitat Steward Training (Boone)
DESCRIPTION:Join NCWF and NCWF High Country Wild Chapter for three fun-filled days of renowned speakers and hands-on activities at the Watauga County Cooperative Extension Office in Boone! Come participate in NCWF’s Wildlife Habitat Steward Training program and become a certified wildlife habitat steward. This program will allow participants to increase their knowledge and ability to protect\, conserve\, and restore habitat for wildlife. Participants will also have the opportunity to engage with experts and fellow conservation enthusiasts about a variety of wildlife topics. Application is required and due by April 12th. \nAPPLY HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/high-country-habitat-stewards-training-boone/
CATEGORIES:Featured
END:VEVENT
