LAST-MODIFIED:20260422T155150Z
UID:10001595-1779274800-1779291000@ncwf.org
SUMMARY:Wildlife Conservation Assistance for Private Landowners (New Bern)
DESCRIPTION:Join the NC Wildlife Federation\, Down East Prescribed Burn Association\, and the Onslow Bight Conservation Collaboration for a BBQ chicken lunch and to learn about forest and wildlife conservation programs for private landowners. Conservation opportunities for landowners can be in the form of technical assistance and funding opportunities. We are bringing in multiple organizations in North Carolina to discuss what they can offer to private landowners interested in wildlife conservation on their properties. There is an optional field tour planned from 1:30 pm-3:30 pm to learn more about managing longleaf pine forests for wildlife. The field tour will occur off-site\, so plan for a short commute from the depot.\nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/conservation-for-private-landowners-new-bern/
CATEGORIES:Featured
END:VEVENT
